window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>They say the most dangerous magick is born from desperation. If that's true, I'm about to become a force of nature.</b></p> <p>The ritual we uncovered has set something in motion that can't be stopped. The fabric of magick is unravelling, and MistHallow Academy stands on the brink of collapse.</p> <p>Our bond—this wild, dark, beautiful thing we've created—is both our greatest strength and our fatal flaw. It's the key to saving everything... or destroying it.</p> <p>My family has resurfaced, their sinister plans for my magick now clear. They're not the only threat. Ancient beings, drawn by the chaos we've unleashed, converge on MistHallow.</p> <p>I'm done running. Done hiding. It's time to embrace the wild card I've always been. I'll risk everything. I'll break curses, rewrite rules, and dance on the knife-edge between salvation and damnation.</p> <p>They wanted to use me? Fine. I'll show them what real power looks like.</p> <p><i>This is a dark paranormal romance. It's book three out of three, in a brand new reverse harem romance by </i>USA Today <i>bestselling author, Eve Newton. Set in England and written in British English. For mature listeners.</i></p>"; 
